## What the diagnosis establishes

**Breakage register (8 findings, all card-cited):**

| Finding | Card(s) |
|---|---|
| Browser artifact is plain ESM, but alpha.2 serves `./client` as a **classic script** that must self-register via `window.__ModuleLoader__.load({id, factory})`, id == package name (reproduced: `SyntaxError: Unexpected token 'export'`) | `DSH-0.1.2-A1-26`, `DSH-0.1.1-R1-01` |
