| Register contract drift: 2-arg bilingual map + private store vs. `addLanguage({id,label,fallback})` + `register(ns, locale, dict)`; no catalog entry → ja/ko/fr never selectable | `DSH-0.1.2-A1-10` |
| `dsh.client.inject` names the removed `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime` → row out of the boot graph | `DSH-0.1.2-A1-25`, `DSH-0.1.1-R1-04` |
| Stale/incoherent peer cohort (removed runtime, five `^0.1.0-rc.8` floors, `cordis ^4.0.1-rc.1`, dead React/UI peers) | `DSH-0.1.2-A2-03`, `DSH-0.1.2-A1-25`, cohort recipe **R-01**, precision-checklist floors |
