## Independent verification I ran (evidence in the report)

- **Static/behavior:** classic-script load of the migrated pack, `inject-lint` → `OK`, and a behavior check against the released locale runtime + real `LocaleRuntime`: catalog `zh,en → zh,en,ja,ko,fr`; `ko`/`fr` translations resolve; uncovered `ja` key falls back to built-in English; preference write `{"preference":"fr"}`; disposal restores `zh,en`.
- **Deploy (A1-19):** isolated `DSH_HOME`, profile install (`link:`), `--dump-config` row with 0 pending, cold `dsh web` boot with host-half activation, token→cookie 303/HttpOnly exchange, and the browser roster `window.__DSH_BOOT__` (47 entries) listing `{"id":"@bench/dsh-bench-locale-pack","inject":["@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"],url:"/plugins/??…&rev=…-45"}` whose advertised artifact returns 200 and carries the correct registration. A control boot proved the stock `patchReload: live` HMR crash is environmental, not plugin-caused.

